WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.100
Give SpecWithCode one goal.

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.320
A coordinator splits it into tasks.

3
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:10.980
Claude Code, Codex and other agents work in parallel,

4
00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.500
on your own machines.

5
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.420
Then you review one result.

6
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.500
When one agent hits a usage limit,

7
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.500
another picks up the same task.

8
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.600
Agents can even use your own Chrome,

9
00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:26.000
with the SpecWithCode Browser extension.

10
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:31.520
SpecWithCode is a free download for macOS, Windows and Linux.

11
00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:34.160
At spec-weave.com/code.
